WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.750
- You can imagine it's not super easy

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.370
to just buy a bridge and
build all this stuff.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.480
It's our American dream,
not everybody dreams

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.440
of picket fences and houses;
we dreamt of a bridge.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.330
Bungee jumping gets categorized as more

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.520
of a a carnival ride, but
for me and my friends,

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.870
it's kind of our sanctuary.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.170
It's not fear; it's just happiness.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.163
Pure happiness.

00:00:22.554 --> 00:00:25.137
(upbeat music)

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.060
My name is Doug Frutos.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.430
There's four of us that
own Vertigo Bungee.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.100
We've been friends a long time;

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.880
been jumping for decades.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.560
We met almost 30 years ago,

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:55.840
and we've been bungee jumping ever since.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.540
The memories that we have
together are priceless.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.950
It's amazing that we've
been friends that long.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.180
We have owned the Young's
High Bridge for six years,

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.220
and on the East Coast, we are pretty much

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:09.650
the only ones that jump from a bridge.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.160
Bungee jumping from bridges

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.720
is the best way to do it;
that's where bungee jumping

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.433
came from originally was from bridges;

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.470
and most bridges have that
scenic natural environment,

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.470
which is a lot nicer than a parking lot.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:32.258
(upbeat music)

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.120
Because we own this bridge,
we've been able to create

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.270
the perfect environment
for bungee jumping.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:40.810
We have the skill and the ability

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:43.660
to make people feel
confident and comfortable.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.420
You know, we love what we do, we wanna see

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.190
everybody jump and have a great time.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:50.220
Yeah we'll get started, and have fun.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:53.170
We get every single type of
person you can imagine up here.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.817
You get people that
came out here thinking,

00:01:55.817 --> 00:01:58.450
"I'd never do this," they came
out to watch their friend,

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.440
the next thing you know, they're jumping

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:01.310
off of the bridge three times.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:02.800
It is a very safe activity

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.960
and allows people to push their limits.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.350
When we're out here,
it puts you in a place

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:09.960
that's just focused on the moment;

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.340
you're not thinking about the bills;

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.820
you're not thinking about relationships;

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:13.850
you're not thinking about anything

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.350
but what's happening to you and what

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:16.630
you're seeing right in front of you.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.940
I mean, those seconds,
they're slow seconds,

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.203
they seem longer.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:23.450
Everything slows down, it's a time,

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:25.090
a short time but it is a time

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:26.890
that I can just focus on the moment.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.280
I don't really ever wanna stop so.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:36.870
- Even when you're 80 years
old, you want to keep going?

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:38.006
- If I can, yeah.

00:02:38.006 --> 00:02:39.488
(Doug laughing)

00:02:39.488 --> 00:02:41.870
(upbeat music)

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.490
I don't see a day that I'm
gonna stop bungee jumping,

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.020
and I don't think my partners will either.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.050
We're gonna jump as much as we can

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:50.220
until we can't anymore.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:53.133
Coming up on 30 years
and going on 40 or 50.

